### Phase 5: Commit, Push, and Create PR

1. **Review created files** — Verify all files are in place:
   ```
   AccordionCRBugsTestBed/
     AccordionCRBugsTestBed/
       Bug_{BugId}.xaml
       Bug_{BugId}.xaml.cs
       MainPage.xaml.cs       (updated navigation)
     UITests.Shared/Test/
       Bug_{BugId}Tests.cs
   ```

2. **Stage and commit:**
   ```bash
   git add .
   git commit -m "Automation: Add test cases for Bug #{BugId}

   - Added bug reproduction sample: Bug_{BugId}.xaml
   - Created {N} test cases covering {platforms}
   - Screenshot comparison baselines pending first run
   - Generated by PR Automation Agent on {date}"
   ```

3. **Push feature branch:**
   ```bash
   git push origin automation/Bug_{BugId}
   ```

4. **Generate PR description** using the automation PR template:
   ```
   read_file .github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE/automation_pr_template.md
   ```
   Fill in all template fields with data gathered in previous phases.

5. **Create PR via Gitea:**
   ```bash
   pwsh .github/skills/gitea-ops/scripts/gitea.ps1 \
       -Repository "maui-accordion-tests" \
       -Operation create-pr \
       -Title "Automation: Bug #{BugId} - {ShortDescription}" \
       -Body "{GeneratedPRBody}" \
       -HeadBranch "automation/Bug_{BugId}" \
       -BaseBranch "development"
   ```

6. **(Optional) Link Azure DevOps work item:**
   ```bash
   pwsh .github/skills/azure-devops-ops/scripts/ado.ps1 \
       -Operation update -WorkItemId {BugId} \
       -Description "Automated test PR created: {PRLink}"
   ```

7. **Generate and display the execution summary report** covering:
   - Control identified
   - PRs analyzed (with bug IDs, platforms, status)
   - Test cases created (test class, count, platforms)
   - Files created/modified
   - PRs created (repository, PR #, title, branch)
   - Skills used
   - Run commands for verification

---

### Phase 6: Cross-Check — Ruthless Quality Gate (MANDATORY)

**This phase is NOT optional. It MUST execute immediately after Phase 5 completes.**

**Motto: Trust nothing. Verify everything. Fix what's broken.**

Execute ALL 8 checkpoints below in sequence. Do NOT skip any. Read actual files — never assume correctness based on earlier phases.

```
Checkpoint 1: Data Integrity       → Validate doc/crbugs.md completeness
    |
Checkpoint 2: Project Structure    → Verify AccordionCRBugsTestBed exists and is correct
    |
Checkpoint 3: Bug Sample Audit     → Inspect every Bug_{BugId}.xaml + .xaml.cs
    |
Checkpoint 4: Test Class Audit     → Inspect every Bug_{BugId}Tests.cs
    |
Checkpoint 5: Navigation Audit     → Verify MainPage.xaml.cs has all entries
    |
Checkpoint 6: Code Quality         → Rules compliance check (15 critical rules)
    |
Checkpoint 7: Git & PR Audit       → Branch, commit, push, PR validation
    |
Checkpoint 8: Final Verdict        → PASS / FAIL with itemized report
```

#### Severity Levels

| Severity | Impact | Action |
|----------|--------|--------|
| BLOCKER | Instant FAIL | Must fix before pass — auto-fix if possible, else report to user |
| CRITICAL | -10 points | Fix required — auto-fix in-place |
| WARNING | -2 points | Log and continue |

---

