Read the file: `read_file doc/crbugs.md`

| # | Check | How to Verify | Severity |
|---|-------|---------------|----------|
| 1.1 | File exists | `doc/crbugs.md` must exist and be non-empty | BLOCKER |
| 1.2 | All PRs documented | Every PR number provided by user must have a `## PR #{N}` section | BLOCKER |
| 1.3 | All 10 data points present | Each PR section must contain all 10 fields from extraction table | CRITICAL |
